post_install() {
    cat <<'NOTE'
prev: optional helpers
  wl-clipboard  copy and paste images
  libheif       HEIC and AVIF images
  curl          pictures dropped from a browser as a web address

Some Hyprland setups make every window slightly see-through, which dims
photos and pages. To keep prev opaque, add this line to
~/.config/hypr/hyprland.lua:

  o.window("^run\\.prev$", { tag = "-default-opacity", opacity = "1 1" })
NOTE
}

post_upgrade() {
    :
}
